Recommends: amneziawg | amneziawg-dkms
Suggests: network-manager-gnome
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for AmneziaWG
 Adds an "AmneziaWG" VPN type to GNOME Settings and nm-connection-editor,
 including import/export of AmneziaWG .conf files (Jc/Jmin/Jmax, S1-S4,
 H1-H4, I1-I5 obfuscation parameters). Uses the amneziawg kernel module
 and amneziawg-tools (awg) from ppa:amnezia/ppa.
